You were successful.

This vessel is now yours to wield.

But it is no easy task, the others in the hive told you so numerous times.

You don't heed their warnings.

Instead, you lift your new body off the ground and stumble as you try to get ahold of how complex movement is.

Finally, you start heading in the direction your host knows best.

[background arg="res://sprites/backgrounds/_0/BG_Scene_3.png" fade="0.5"]

You have almost made it.

Made it out of this pitiful existence without purpose.

Made it out of home and into the unknown.

